  {
    "id": 1018003010010,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "はぁ？\r\nあんた何言ってんの、受けるに決まってんでしょ",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_jito",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "018",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは……そう、だと思うんだ\r\n普段なら",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも今は、『G.R.A.D.』も始まったし──\r\nこの状況で、密着取材を受けるっていうのは",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010020,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010030,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『冬優子の負担になりすぎるんじゃないか』\r\n──とでも言うつもり？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……その可能性もある、と思った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "断った方がいいと思ってるわけじゃない\r\nただ、難しいと感じるなら遠慮なく言ってほしいって──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010040,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……減点です♡",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "060",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010050,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆのプロデューサーさんとして、\r\nその采配は減点ですって言ったんですよ♡",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010050"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010060,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──だってそうでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010070,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』なんて大きなオーディションで、\r\nふゆに密着したいって言ってる番組があるのに──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010080,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "そのチャンスを逃そうとしてるんだもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010090,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ねぇ？\r\nふゆがそんなことすると思う？",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "冬優子ならそう言うんじゃないかっていうのも、考えたよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……でも、プロデューサーとして、\r\n懸念は伝えなきゃいけないと思った",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "取材を入れるということは、\r\nふとした瞬間でも、気を抜けなくなるってことだから",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでかかる負担は──\r\n言われなくたって、冬優子が一番理解してるだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010100,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "shrug2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "受けたい仕事なのは重々承知してる\r\nだからこそ、ちゃんと考えて決めてほしいんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──受けたい仕事で、『ベストを尽くせなかった』なんて\r\n後悔することがないように",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010110,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "はーあ……\r\n……っとに、心配性ね……",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010120,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……ま、言いたいことは大体わかったわ\r\nお気遣いどーも",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010130,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──じゃ、ふゆからの、ちゃんと考えた答えを言うわよ？\r\n『その仕事、受けておいて』",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……いいんだな？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010140,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "トーゼンでしょ\r\nしんどいことなんて承知の上で──",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010150,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "もしかしたら、その番組も？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010160,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "『清純派アイドルの裏の顔！』なんてのを見つけたいから\r\nふゆのところに来たのかも──とかも、承知の上で",
    "charAnim1": "smile4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010170,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "──その上で\r\n非の打ちどころがないアイドルってのを見せてやるわ",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010180,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "誰かの予想を裏切るの、大好きなの",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──わかった\r\n疑うような聞き方をして、申し訳ない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010190,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "まったくね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "先方には、OKだって伝えておくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──冬優子の姿、ひとりでも多くの人に届けような\r\nサポートは任せてくれ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad_s",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010200,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "変わり身の早いこと！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010210,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "……それと、当たり前のことをキメて言わないでよね\r\nあんたはふゆのプロデューサーでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010220,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆのサポートも、ふゆの魅力を伝えるのも、通常業務",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1018003010230,
    "speaker": "冬優子",
    "text": "ふゆが頑張るんだから、あんたにだってもちろん、\r\n普段以上の努力を要求するわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "fuyuko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101800301/1018003010230"
  },
